      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在严寒的季节，水结冰引起岩石逐渐地破裂."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**例题**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**1.** 直径$D=0.8$毫米的黄铜导线，长$L=3.6$米. 在力",
        "$F=25$牛顿的作用下，导线伸长$\\Delta l=2$毫米. 试求黄铜的杨",
        "氏模量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**解：** 根据胡克定律公式$\\sigma=E\\cdot|\\varepsilon|$，求得$E=\\frac{\\sigma}{|\\varepsilon|}$，或者，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "考虑到$\\sigma=\\frac{F}{S}$和$|\\varepsilon|=\\frac{|\\Delta l|}{l_0}$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$E=\\frac{Fl_0}{S\\cdot|\\Delta l|}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为$S=\\frac{\\pi D^2}{4}$，所以，$E=\\frac{4Fl_0}{\\pi D^2\\cdot|\\Delta l|}$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$E=9\\times10^{10}$牛顿/米$^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**2.** 把质量$m_2=0.4$千克、温度$t_2=0^\\circ\\text{C}$的冰放到温度",
        "$t_1=75^\\circ\\text{C}$的铝制大容器中，建立热平衡以后，温度等于$t_3=↵50^\\circ\\text{C}$. 容器的质量$m_1$是多大？铝的比热$c_1=880$焦耳/(千克·度).",
        "**忽略水的蒸发.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**解：** 容器放出的热量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$Q_1=c_1m_1(t_3-t_1)$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "是负的，因为$t_3<t_1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "冰熔解所需的热量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$Q_2=\\lambda m_2$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "而水从$0^\\circ\\text{C}$加热到$t_3$需要热量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$Q_3=c_2m_2(t_3-t_2)$."
      ]
    },
